{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）和李炘頤（Alina）日前在峇里舉行浪漫戶外婚禮，一對新人﹑兄弟姊妹團及賓客已陸續返港。</p><p>昨晚Stanley和Alina已抵港，兄弟團的李駿傑（Jeremy）和呂爵安也回港。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:37.054075+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:57:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T09:38:38.108028+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:38:38.108028+00:00","content_hash":"2fa2480ea51892db3606aace0990a23c3f86c4fc73543e8c72397247c0c2c63e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}